  m_elements:
  - guidHash: 540778221
    text: Everyone has gold in their pockets, just gotta beat it out of em.
  - guidHash: -782171836
    text: You found a oddly large toe, seems lucky?
  - guidHash: 622652962
    text: What could go better with a nice refreshing potion?
  - guidHash: 24740854
    text: A lovely warm bath, in what appears to be...cream?
  - guidHash: 1251865343
    text: Nothing is quite as holy as the simple chest.
  - guidHash: 1233549183
    text: Destroy relics for blessings.
  - guidHash: -39074577
    text: At their core, relics are just blessings with extra steps.
  - guidHash: -1770773694
    text: 'The jacket itself is fine, but for some reason, a bunch of the peasents
      here got super weird about me wearing it. '
  - guidHash: -1680524717
    text: 'Curiosity and exploration can rejuvenate the soul. '
  - guidHash: -2000754098
    text: Peasants are issued one pair of boots a year. The boots never last an entire
      year.
  - guidHash: -1840453806
    text: Tasty rainbow
  - guidHash: -650230487
    text: An old explorer once said that gold can be found in hidden places.
  - guidHash: -2139671564
    text: 'The most magic wand in the known world, but also the most fragile. '
  - guidHash: 1918558942
    text: The Emperor shines his light down on you.
  - guidHash: -1655286976
    text: Pilfers are known for stealing gold, but storing it for you, well thats
      new.
  - guidHash: 1670328365
    text: Why would you keep these sharp blades in your pockets? Seems unwise.
  - guidHash: 1874654790
    text: Gilded Gauntlets
  - guidHash: -1421196385
    text: Worn by Sanctum sculptors to appear regal and powerful, trying to mask
      the philistine lies.
  - guidHash: -615636160
    text: Due fly related accident during its forging, the handle of this massive
      tool is quite a bit shorter than it should be.
  - guidHash: 2111729323
    text: A novelty keychain found on the keys to Black Rabbit's cell.
  - guidHash: 1567832749
    text: Due to a fly related accident during it's forging, the handle of this massive
      tool is quite a bit shorter than it should be.
  - guidHash: -1005969797
    text: 'In the darkness there is light. '
  - guidHash: -1304172307
    text: Sometimes the mines unearth ancient secrets not meant for any being to
      lay their eyes upon. This is one such horror.
  - guidHash: 43963526
    text: 'An ingenious inventor came to the faith late, and made the most of his
      second life. '
  - guidHash: 1860610704
    text: Beltrame creates some wonderful potions, but I do wonder where all the
      waste goes?
  - guidHash: 1732413302
    text: 'A totem depicting an ancient god of life and the natural order. '
  - guidHash: 584029238
    text: 'Normally a healthy lifestyle makes for a healthy body, but peasants make
      due with what they got. '
  - guidHash: -180616374
    text: Hoarding gold has always been a tatic of the wealthy and elite, no wonder
      they seem so powerful.
  - guidHash: -67876275
    text: Every little helps.
  - guidHash: -37702875
    text: The shop holds many secrets, and you've just been let in on one.
  - guidHash: -1536217873
    text: A key that looks like it could open any door.
  - guidHash: -1124808619
    text: Nothing quite says fool like some fool's gold.
  - guidHash: 303701289
    text: 'This Elderseed seems to have mutated, it oozes something that doesn''t
      look very nice. '
  - guidHash: -717052596
    text: These pilfers will shake down anyone who crosses their path if it means
      a little extra gold.
  - guidHash: 232501871
    text: The plague is a familar blight of the peasant and with that comes the rats.
  - guidHash: -1923232017
    text: Nothing quite like helping out a local business.
  - guidHash: 700904090
    text: The best things in life are those that are free!
  - guidHash: -1922036168
    text: A kernel of corn, blessed by a mighty priest who thought it may bring good
      luck to the future harvest.
  - guidHash: 606738836
    text: Plant Leaf
  - guidHash: -754791869
    text: These little leaves look like they are quite edible.
  - guidHash: 276503105
    text: These gold pieces would have prefered to stay lodged with the rocks.
  - guidHash: -439612761
    text: A token of friendship between the pilfers and peasants of Delvemore.
  - guidHash: -1305441280
    text: RIP AND TEAR UNTIL IT IS DONE.
  - guidHash: -1372392542
    text: I wonder who these skulls used to belong to?
  - guidHash: 735039217
    text: 'This thief''s tool bears the engraving of a rabbit. Also, an engraving
      that reads "Black Rabbit''s, hands off!" Further down it also reads "Seriously!" '
  - guidHash: -526797796
    text: Always eat your veggies!
  - guidHash: -923546745
    text: Transmute Statue Cost Increase
  - guidHash: 1983987256
    text: Its too cheap in the base game.
  - guidHash: -754573880
    text: Too much gold in the base game.
  - guidHash: 1192452755
    text: Enemies are too weak in the base game.
  - guidHash: 470154009
    text: Dont take enough damage in the base game.
  - guidHash: -1503613438
    text: HP too high in base game.
  - guidHash: 452927784
    text: 'Strength and Dexterity are too high in the base game. '
  - guidHash: 2135772902
    text: Deals with the devil are never quite worth the price you pay.
  - guidHash: -1065593332
    text: A tasty little leaf.
  - guidHash: -2060143959
    text: Gloves worn by the old guard to ward off evil spirits.
  - guidHash: 1160186849
    text: This candle protects from danger but something about it seems unnatural.
  - guidHash: 1466046654
    text: Wealth, but at what cost?
  - guidHash: 1137579462
    text: Seems like Sho'guul and the shopkeeper made a deal.
  - guidHash: 258623003
    text: Coffee, straight into the veins, all the time.
  - guidHash: -1422381718
    text: Shroud your body in metal so that you may feel no pain.
  - guidHash: -1453147761
    text: No pain no gain.
  - guidHash: 967036207
    text: This gift comes at a cost.
  - guidHash: -2043486611
    text: Food just doesnt taste the same without your special seasoning.
  - guidHash: -48610449
    text: These boots seem strange.
  - guidHash: 208914220
    text: Baggledag has a bounty on his head, will you be the one to claim it?
  - guidHash: 888883818
    text: To desecrate an altar of worship is to laugh in the face of the greater
      powers.
  - guidHash: -527607219
    text: These shockwaves really do pack quite the punch.
  - guidHash: 1495782128
    text: The metal this pickaxe is made from seems strange?
  - guidHash: 289416233
    text: The master's wear these hats to hone their magical powers.
  - guidHash: 1147454776
    text: A force to be reckoned with.
  - guidHash: -1195403896
    text: All donations are welcome. But who is collecting them?
  - guidHash: -391569514
    text: Chrysopoeia
  - guidHash: -1707543074
    text: Gold nuggets have a chance to be upgraded when the land.
  - guidHash: 1424617820
    text: Chrysopoeia is the art of creating gold from nothing, an endless cycle
      to be repeated.
  - guidHash: 1610991395
    text: Expert Explorer
  - guidHash: -1916633534
    text: Secret rooms have a chance to contain more than usual.
  - guidHash: -1102772234
    text: These worn papers can still be of some use.
  - guidHash: 682646194
    text: Perfect Blend
  - guidHash: 91360686
    text: Using a potion actives a random timed potion effect.
  - guidHash: -726174470
    text: This concoction can be quite deadly if you don't know what you're doing.
  - guidHash: 1380617407
    text: Insight
  - guidHash: 983936473
    text: Lowers the cost of using your Arcana.
  - guidHash: 970320576
    text: Through insight we gain enlightenment.
  - guidHash: 1431548255
    text: Corrupted Altars
  - guidHash: 836901224
    text: Gain an additonal curse from Altars but is always removed when using Penance.
  - guidHash: -1225464520
    text: These Altars seem to spew dark light from every crack.
  - guidHash: -1596639059
    text: Divine Touch
  - guidHash: 1159566258
    text: Chance to heal enemies on hit.
  - guidHash: 127420662
    text: Healing hand are not always the blessing they appear to be.
  - guidHash: 424238075
    text: Golden Touch
  - guidHash: -1644304591
    text: Adds a chance to knock gold nuggets out of struck enemies.
  - guidHash: -846465979
    text: Mini Mattock
  - guidHash: -1968013997
    text: Massively increases Alacrity but also heavily lowers reach.
  - guidHash: -1026828664
    text: Stuffed Sandwich
  - guidHash: 1281558143
    text: All potions heal you for a small amount on use.
  - guidHash: -1108866584
    text: Pilfer Bank
  - guidHash: 1930611847
    text: Gain lots of stats but breaks when you spend any gold.
  - guidHash: -377645632
    text: Add a chance to apply gilde to enemies on hit.
  - guidHash: 1598319772
    text: Guantes' Raincoat
  - guidHash: -845948562
    text: Prevents elemental status effects.
  - guidHash: -1792935340
    text: Cream Bath
  - guidHash: -1016801395
    text: Gain Physical damage resistance for a short time after being hit.
  - guidHash: -1769657135
    text: Blessed Chest
  - guidHash: 479530548
    text: Gives a 25% chance to discover a random blessing in every chest.
  - guidHash: -1602624992
    text: Obsidian Wand
  - guidHash: 1609995291
    text: Dramatically increases mana, but breaks when hit.
  - guidHash: 1088214855
    text: Mega Mattock
  - guidHash: -1459315563
    text: Give a huge boost to Reach and Strength but sets Alacrity to 1 for the
      rest of the run.
  - guidHash: -1671121772
    text: Playdough Pickaxe
  - guidHash: 1089042749
    text: Each hit has a chance to do a different elemental damage effect.
  - guidHash: 1127976449
    text: Recycler V2
  - guidHash: 2024650576
    text: Destroy relics for blessings. Only works on relics found in relic rooms!
  - guidHash: 10095820
    text: Giant's Toe
  - guidHash: -1178399722
    text: Killing enemies has a small chance to increase your luck!
  - guidHash: -1237065613
    text: Sharp Pockets
  - guidHash: -82024814
    text: Spending gold deals damage to you.
  - guidHash: -1938340126
    text: Tenderfoot
  - guidHash: -2074747749
    text: Take damage when you land after jumping.
  - guidHash: -622005679
    text: Regeneration
  - guidHash: -1731503541
    text: Heal for 1 HP when pathfinding
  - guidHash: -142455601
    text: Adventurous
  - guidHash: -1649103270
    text: Visiting secret rooms gives gold, scales based on what floor you are on.
  - guidHash: 1448832851
    text: Emperor's Might
  - guidHash: -1819620339
    text: Gives a small % increase to Strength, Dexterity and Intelligence.
  - guidHash: 280339030
    text: Totem of Life
  - guidHash: 1664160250
    text: Heal for 6 HP when pathfinding.
  - guidHash: -1540076425
    text: Aphotic Charm
  - guidHash: -962372198
    text: Heal for every curse you have when pathfinding
  - guidHash: 2047859672
    text: Thunder Stuck
  - guidHash: -19843859
    text: Sometimes get hit by lightning, giving you potion effects for a short duration
  - guidHash: 1635371893
    text: Blessed popcorn
  - guidHash: -101673242
    text: blessings that hit the floor have a chance to duplicate.
  - guidHash: 1145902201
    text: Inverter
  - guidHash: -27869745
    text: lost curses become blessings.
  - guidHash: 1685269973
    text: Bottled Brimstone
  - guidHash: -1842885268
    text: When swinging fire a brimstone beam of fire when you are aiming, destroying
      rocks and damaging enemies, takes away 25% of max HP.
  - guidHash: -1317969372
    text: Heartiness
  - guidHash: -1467839534
    text: Increases the effectiveness of healing.
  - guidHash: -1126349855
    text: Empowered Gold
  - guidHash: -573854356
    text: Strength increases with the amount of gold you hold.
  - guidHash: -1379132982
    text: Humbleing Help
  - guidHash: 1865393030
    text: Adds a chance for keys and bombs to be upgraded.
  - guidHash: -918760315
    text: Skeleton Key
  - guidHash: 785984054
    text: Skulls can be used as keys.
  - guidHash: 330009733
    text: Pilfer Club Card
  - guidHash: 1978834012
    text: The shop now always contains access to a special extra shop.
  - guidHash: 111030044
    text: Agressive Couponing
  - guidHash: -929206894
    text: Gain 1-3 Charism with any shop purchase.
  - guidHash: 894832681
    text: Free Gift
  - guidHash: -1782761348
    text: Get a free potion in every shop!
  - guidHash: 275310752
    text: Fool's Gold
  - guidHash: 1257618839
    text: Sometimes gold will break on hitting the ground.
  - guidHash: -95907248
    text: Mutated Mana
  - guidHash: -1086066309
    text: Loss some mana when pathfinding.
  - guidHash: -1782119105
    text: Pilfered Pockets
  - guidHash: 1239495119
    text: Bumping into pilfers costs you some gold.
  - guidHash: -1254073212
    text: Resourceful Rats
  - guidHash: -24385517
    text: Pilfers are replaced with rats.
  - guidHash: 814718738
    text: Yummy Veggies
  - guidHash: 1774883278
    text: Plants will occasionally shed edible leaves that heal you.
  - guidHash: -222001710
    text: Trap Disarm Toolkit
  - guidHash: 293970505
    text: Destroys all traps upon room entry.
  - guidHash: -1584570444
    text: Skull Smasher
  - guidHash: -1827855000
    text: Picking up a skull increases your max HP by 5.
  - guidHash: 1305870854
    text: Skilled Slayer
  - guidHash: 792968762
    text: Killing enemies increases your primary stats.
  - guidHash: -1675605753
    text: Gold is attracted towards you and gives a 20% shop discount.
  - guidHash: 93597975
    text: Scared Nuggets
  - guidHash: -1283686459
    text: Gold will try to run away from you.
  - guidHash: -2016421984
    text: Anointed Gloves
  - guidHash: -241110271
    text: Gain Dexterity for each unique blessing you have.
  - guidHash: 779550364
    text: Cursed Blessings
  - guidHash: 590336404
    text: Drops a copy of your lowest level blessing when you gain a curse.
  - guidHash: -85737731
    text: Cursed Fortune
  - guidHash: 430377920
    text: Gives 8000 gold but gain a random curse permanently.
  - guidHash: -1643393907
    text: Devil's Discount
  - guidHash: -831717502
    text: Gain a 70% shop discount but get a curse every 3rd purchase.
  - guidHash: -1263866586
    text: Drip Coffee
  - guidHash: -396181352
    text: Increase your Speed and Alacrity
  - guidHash: -450620636
    text: Hurts So Good
  - guidHash: -564606197
    text: After penance become immune to the next instance of damage and heal for
      a portion of the damage taken.
  - guidHash: -2145972307
    text: Silver Juicer
  - guidHash: -1142767431
    text: Elderseeds increase max HP by 3.
  - guidHash: -252458135
    text: Elderseeds are full of juice but it's not so easy to get.
  - guidHash: 1976540978
    text: Special Seasoning
  - guidHash: -460986270
    text: Hitting food has a chance to reroll it.
  - guidHash: -950523629
    text: Full Metal Jacket
  - guidHash: -952900758
    text: Adds 5 armor pips. Removes all HP. Replaces all food with armor. Gives
      immunity to damage over time effects.
  - guidHash: 1145511058
    text: Sho'Guul's Gift
  - guidHash: -525751354
    text: Removes 2 relics at random and gives 4 random new relics.
  - guidHash: -1536546593
    text: Desecration
  - guidHash: 974433610
    text: Bombing Altars gives an additonal blessing.
  - guidHash: 1769575082
    text: Magnetic Pickaxe
  - guidHash: 1831498259
    text: Pickaxe swings pull enemies closer towards you.
  - guidHash: -1509218046
    text: Master's Hat
  - guidHash: -1901203545
    text: Increase Intelligence by 15% for each relic you hold that scaling with
      Intelligence.
  - guidHash: -709861488
    text: Knock Waves
  - guidHash: -148559360
    text: Shockwaves knock enemies back, dealing some damage when they land.
  - guidHash: -1630707366
    text: Tithe
  - guidHash: -44344328
    text: Changes the cost of Penance from health to gold.
  - guidHash: -1989064432
    text: Boss Bounty
  - guidHash: 433799246
    text: Get a relic after each boss you kill.
  - guidHash: 1593266280
    text: Reckfullness
  - guidHash: -1950366414
    text: Deal additonal damage to enemies based on your Recklessness.
  - guidHash: 104519486
    text: Magentized Boots
  - guidHash: -1684241261
    text: When you land after jumping, push gold away and suck enemies towards you.
  - guidHash: 1970704
    text: Enemy HP Increase
  - guidHash: -1990637715
    text: Increases enemy and boss HP by 20%.
  - guidHash: 1970241786
    text: Reduced Gold Value
  - guidHash: 191265038
    text: Recieved 20% less gold from all sources.
  - guidHash: -1379285301
    text: Reduced Max HP
  - guidHash: 837579878
    text: Reduces Max HP by 100.
  - guidHash: -131383923
    text: Reduced Damage
  - guidHash: 33383014
    text: Reduces Strength and Dexterity by 12. Only recommended for Peasant.
  - guidHash: -655481644
    text: Take More Damage
  - guidHash: 1311981432
    text: Increases damage taken by 20%
  - guidHash: -891095621
    text: Transmute Cost Increased
  - guidHash: 1177468129
    text: Increases the cost of trasmute statues by 2.5x and curse transmute by 3.5x.
  - guidHash: 949143614
    text: Pilfer Ring
  - guidHash: 1468347851
    text: Adjust Difficulty Here!
  - guidHash: -1782129502
    text: Meta Currency Replacer
  - guidHash: -1101523867
    text: Once you have everything unlocked, Thorium and Crowns are useless. This
      replaces Thorium with gold, replaces blue chests with regular chests and removes
      the chest after defeating each boss.
  - guidHash: 828147858
    text: Thorium and Crowns and useless after everything is unlocked.
